# ScoreSense — always follow

Before any user-facing work, read `docs/PRODUCT.md`. If another doc conflicts, `docs/PRODUCT.md` wins. Update it in the same change when you add a destination, name, token, or pattern.

## Product

ScoreSense (4th Down Labs) is a fantasy football product with three top-level areas only:

- **Projections** — Weekly / Season (Preseason outlook, Live season)
- **Fantasy** — leagues, draft, contracts, cap, waivers, trades, rules
- **Tools** — DFS, Mock draft, Best ball

Do not add a fourth top-level area. Do not call Fantasy “League” or “Draft Hub” in UI copy. “Draft Hub” is an internal code name.

Account-only destinations: Model accuracy, Admin, Account, Report a bug, Sign in, Create account.

## Canonical user-facing names

